{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t廣東順德昨日有紡織廠起火，造成8人死亡，1人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n火警在昨日下午發生，目前搜救工作仍在繼續。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T03:39:04.735925+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":54,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none"}}